    [6721]={name="Chestplate of Kor",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Supplies to Auberdine” — pick it over the other choices. In Ashenvale.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Supplies to Auberdine",lore="Delgren has asked me to deliver messages and supplies to Sentinel Starbreeze in Auberdine, but I am loathe to leave on my own."},
    [6722]={name="Beastial Manacles",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Fallen Sky Lake” — pick it over the other choices. In Ashenvale.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Fallen Sky Lake",lore="Relara's fever has passed, but she is still very weak. I do not believe time alone will give her back the strength she has lost. I believe it will take the power of a moonstone."},
    [6723]={name="Medal of Courage",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Saving Yenniku” — pick it over the other choices. In Stranglethorn Vale.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Saving Yenniku",lore="I have reshaped the Mind's Eye into a Soul Gem. Its purpose is twofold: you must use it to stun Yenniku, and once stunned place it upon his head to entrap his soul."},
    [6725]={name="Marbled Buckler",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Crone of the Kraul” — pick it over the other choices. In Razorfen Kraul.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",questName="The Crone of the Kraul",lore="Poor Heralath! And this dwarf... Lonebrow. What a brave soul he was. We must not let their valiance go for naught. This crone... Charlga Razorflank..."},
    [6730]={name="Ironforge Chain",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 1).",profession="Blacksmithing"},
    [6731]={name="Ironforge Breastplate",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 1).",profession="Blacksmithing"},
    [6742]={name="Stonefist Girdle",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Crone of the Kraul” — pick it over the other choices. In Razorfen Kraul.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",questName="The Crone of the Kraul",lore="Poor Heralath! And this dwarf... Lonebrow. What a brave soul he was. We must not let their valiance go for naught. This crone... Charlga Razorflank..."},
    [6744]={name="Gloves of Kapelan",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Alliance Relations” — pick it over the other choices. In Orgrimmar.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Alliance Relations",lore="The fight goes well. Perhaps the Warchief will allow us to return to our homes before the seasons change if we continue to make such great strides in our battle against the demons and their underlings."},
    [6747]={name="Enforcer Pauldrons",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Corrupter” — pick it over the other choices. In Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="The Corrupter",lore="Although I have no knowledge of this Lord Azrethoc, I agree with Maurin, he must be stopped; especially if he is attempting to gain influence over the Burning Blade to further his goals."},
    [6749]={name="Tiger Band",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Willix the Importer” — pick it over the other choices. In Razorfen Kraul.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",questName="Willix the Importer",lore="At last, help has arrived! You have no clue how long I've been held prisoner here. I can't remember the last time I saw the outside of this place."},
    [6751]={name="Mourning Shawl",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Mortality Wanes” — pick it over the other choices. In Razorfen Kraul.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",questName="Mortality Wanes",lore="I have not long to live... so... so... weak....the b-b-brave dwarf, Lonebrow, has been sent to w-w-warn Falfindel... But before I... d-d-die......my wife, Treshala..."},
    [6773]={name="Gelkis Marauder Chain",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Khan Hratha” — pick it over the other choices. In Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="Khan Hratha",lore="you helped us against the Magram. Now, help us beat the Maraudine! Kill the head of their clan, Khan Hratha! To face him, blow the Maraudine War Horn."},
    [6791]={name="Hellion Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Karnitol Shipwreck” — pick it over the other choices. In Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="The Karnitol Shipwreck",lore="Take Karnitol's things back to Roetten in Ironforge and he'll pay you for a job well done. Haha, if you're not careful, he's gonna be so pleased with ya that he'll ask you to join us full time."},
    [6793]={name="Auric Bracers",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Reagents for Reclaimers Inc.” — pick it over the other choices. In Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="Reagents for Reclaimers Inc.",lore="To get paid, you're gonna have to get back to Ironforge and speak to Roetten himself. He'll love getting Leftwitch's package out of the way anyway."},
    [6802]={name="Sword of Omen",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Into The Scarlet Monastery” — pick it over the other choices. In Scarlet Monastery.",zone="Scarlet Monastery",questName="Into The Scarlet Monastery",lore="Whilst the Dark Lady tends to the pressing issue of the Lich King's advance to the north, I am seeing to it that matters closer to home are being taken care of accordingly."},
    [6804]={name="Windstorm Hammer",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Final Passage” — pick it over the other choices. In Thousand Needles.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Final Passage",lore="You have done well. You have passed my test, and the tests before mine. Return to Dorn in Thousand Needles."},
    [6829]={name="Sword of Serenity",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “In the Name of the Light” — pick it over the other choices. In Scarlet Monastery.",zone="Scarlet Monastery",questName="In the Name of the Light",lore="I once served the Scarlet Crusade with honor, loyalty and pride. I believed their cause to be a noble one: to rid Azeroth of the undead."},
    [6903]={name="Gaze Dreamer Pants",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Twilight Lord Kelris in Blackfathom Deeps.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Twilight Lord Kelris"},
    [6905]={name="Reef Axe",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Gelihast in Blackfathom Deeps.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Gelihast"},
    [6906]={name="Algae Fists",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Gelihast in Blackfathom Deeps.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Gelihast"},
    [6907]={name="Tortoise Armor",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ghamoo-ra in Blackfathom Deeps.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Ghamoo-ra"},
    [6908]={name="Ghamoo-ra's Bind",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ghamoo-ra in Blackfathom Deeps.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Ghamoo-ra",lore="Ghamoo-ra is the ancient turtle the naga keep in Blackfathom Deeps -- old enough that the Twilight cultists there treat it as part of the temple."},
    [6911]={name="Moss Cinch",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Aku'mai in Blackfathom Deeps.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Aku'mai"},
    [6998]={name="Nimbus Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Twilight Falls”. In Blackfathom Deeps.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Twilight Falls",lore="Empowered by the ancient rites of the chaotic Old Gods the members of the Twilight's Hammer strive to bring about the return of their dark patrons and spread death and terror across the world."},
    [7002]={name="Arctic Buckler",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Blackfathom Villainy” — pick it over the other choices. In Blackfathom Deeps.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Blackfathom Villainy",lore="Strength has left me. Your help is needed! Long ago this site was a great temple of Elune. But misfortune led to ruin when the corruption of an Old God seeped up from beneath the earth and tainted the sacred Moon Well."},
