    [10635]={name="Painted Chain Leggings",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Break Sharptusk!” — pick it over the other choices. In Red Cloud Mesa.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="Break Sharptusk!",lore="- I have heard of you, newcomer. Perhaps it is you that will help us, where others have failed. We tauren have carved a home out of this land, but not without a cost."},
    [10637]={name="Brewer's Gloves",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Sample for Helbrim” — pick it over the other choices. In Undercity.",zone="Undercity",questName="Sample for Helbrim",lore="A colleague in Kalimdor, Apothecary Helbrim, is researching the effects of Lordaeron toxins on the beasts of Kalimdor. He would be very interested in a sample of the wolf hearts Renferrel sent me."},
    [10654]={name="Jutebraid Gloves",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Horde Presence” — pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Horde Presence",lore="This scroll is from that scheming dryad Rynthariel, Keymaster of the Talon Den on Stonetalon Peak. She'll not be making any more contact with the messenger you looted this from, heh, but we must stand our ground here."},
    [10657]={name="Talbar Mantle",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “In Nightmares” — pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="In Nightmares",lore="This shard holds great secrets; it is the pure essence of the Emerald Dream. However, what I see in this shard is not a dream; one would call this sort of a vision a nightmare."},
    [10658]={name="Quagmire Galoshes",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “In Nightmares” — pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="In Nightmares",lore="This shard holds great secrets; it is the pure essence of the Emerald Dream. However, what I see in this shard is not a dream; one would call this sort of a vision a nightmare."},
    [10659]={name="Shard of the Splithooves",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Heroes of Old”. In Blasted Lands.",zone="Blasted Lands",questName="Heroes of Old",lore="Please, take from this a relic of old. We no longer have a use for the item. May it serve you well in your fight against the legion."},
    [10686]={name="Aegis of Battle",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Venom to the Undercity” — pick it over the other choices. In The Hinterlands.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Venom to the Undercity",lore="The venom you gathered from the Witherbark's spider god is quite a find! I've been able to kill nearly two dozen rabbits with just a drop of the stuff."},
    [10700]={name="Encarmine Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Brood of Onyxia” — pick it over the other choices. In Dustwallow Marsh.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="The Brood of Onyxia",lore="Onyxia's brood has been scattered across the Dragonmurk. It is imperative that no more whelps be permitted to hatch. Make haste to Wyrmbog in the south of Dustwallow Marsh."},
    [10707]={name="Steelsmith Greaves",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Return to Tymor” — pick it over the other choices. In Ironforge.",zone="Ironforge",questName="Return to Tymor",lore="Tymor didn't give me anything to pay you with, so I suggest you take it up with him when you get back to Ironforge. I'm sure he'll still be in his place in the Mystic Ward."},
    [10710]={name="Dragonclaw Ring",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Extinguishing the Idol”. In Razorfen Downs.",zone="Razorfen Downs",questName="Extinguishing the Idol",lore="Near the entrance is an idol that functions as a macabre oven for the Quilboar; the beasts... they literally consume their abductees from the Barrens."},
    [10711]={name="Dragon's Blood Necklace",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Into The Scarlet Monastery” — pick it over the other choices. In Scarlet Monastery.",zone="Scarlet Monastery",questName="Into The Scarlet Monastery",lore="Whilst the Dark Lady tends to the pressing issue of the Lich King's advance to the north, I am seeing to it that matters closer to home are being taken care of accordingly."},
    [10727]={name="Goblin Dragon Gun",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Engineering (requires skill 1).",profession="Engineering",proc="Use: Deals 61 to 69 fire damage for 10 sec to all targets in a cone in front of the engineer using the weapon.   That is unless it explodes..... (5 Min Cooldown)"},
    [10742]={name="Dragonflight Leggings",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Set Them Ablaze!” — pick it over the other choices. In Searing Gorge.",zone="Searing Gorge",questName="Set Them Ablaze!",lore="Listen well. While the four towers can never be destroyed, you can use the torch of retribution to set them ablaze for a very long period of time: A fire that no element or force can subdue."},
    [10749]={name="Avenguard Helm",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The God Hakkar” — pick it over the other choices. In Sunken Temple.",zone="Sunken Temple",questName="The God Hakkar",lore="Now it is time to capture the essence of the avatar of Hakkar. Take the Egg of Hakkar to the Sanctum of the Fallen God in the Sunken Temple in Azeroth."},
