    [11824]={name="Cyclopean Band",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Ok'thor the Breaker (rare elite).",npc="Ok'thor the Breaker"},
    [11832]={name="Burst of Knowledge",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ambassador Flamelash in Blackrock Depths.",zone="Blackrock Depths",npc="Ambassador Flamelash",lore="Ragnaros's envoy to the Dark Iron in Blackrock Depths, sent to keep the dwarves loyal to the Firelord.",proc="Use: Reduces mana cost of all spells by 100 for 10 sec. (15 Min Cooldown)"},
    [11841]={name="Senior Designer's Pantaloons",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Fineous Darkvire in Blackrock Depths.",zone="Blackrock Depths",npc="Fineous Darkvire"},
    [11849]={name="Rustmetal Bracers",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Scavenging Deathknell” — pick it over the other choices. In Deathknell.",zone="Deathknell",questName="Scavenging Deathknell",lore="You there! If you're looking for something to make yourself useful, then listen up! We need fresh out-of-the-ground recruits to head into Deathknell and search for any sort of useful equipment."},
    [11858]={name="Battlehard Cape",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “A Grim Discovery” — pick it over the other choices. In Feralas.",zone="Feralas",questName="A Grim Discovery",lore="What?! Ah, so I did mention a bounty, didn't I? Well, that'll teach me to open my mouth, won't it? You did the work, so I suppose it is only right you reap the greatest reward from it."},
    [11904]={name="Spirit of Aquementas",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “It's Dangerous to Go Alone” — pick it over the other choices. In Un'Goro Crater.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="It's Dangerous to Go Alone",lore="I finally remember now... I did come here to fight Blazerunner. I was on a journey, and this was to be the last step. But I am no longer the hero..."},
    [11905]={name="Linken's Boomerang",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “It's Dangerous to Go Alone”. In Un'Goro Crater.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="It's Dangerous to Go Alone",lore="I finally remember now... I did come here to fight Blazerunner. I was on a journey, and this was to be the last step. But I am no longer the hero...",proc="Use: Flings a magical boomerang towards target enemy dealing 113 to 187 damage and has a chance to stun or disarm them. (3 Min Cooldown)"},
    [11910]={name="Bejeweled Legguards",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “A Little Help From My Friends” — pick it over the other choices. In Un'Goro Crater.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="A Little Help From My Friends",lore="Ugh... It's so hot... I was exploring this area, when all of a sudden, the heat just became unbearable. I must be suffering from heat exhaustion."},
    [11923]={name="The Hammer of Grace",sourceType="object_drop",instructions="Found in a container.",npc="a container"},
    [11927]={name="Legplates of the Eternal Guardian",sourceType="object_drop",instructions="Found in a container.",npc="a container"},
    [11928]={name="Thaurissan's Royal Scepter",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Emperor Dagran Thaurissan in Blackrock Depths.",zone="Blackrock Depths",npc="Emperor Dagran Thaurissan",lore="Emperor of the Dark Iron, whose ancestor's summoning of Ragnaros doomed the clan. He took Moira Bronzebeard prisoner and she chose to stay."},
    [11933]={name="Imperial Jewel",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Emperor Dagran Thaurissan in Blackrock Depths.",zone="Blackrock Depths",npc="Emperor Dagran Thaurissan",lore="Emperor of the Dark Iron, whose ancestor's summoning of Ragnaros doomed the clan. He took Moira Bronzebeard prisoner and she chose to stay."},
    [11935]={name="Magmus Stone",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Magmus in Blackrock Depths.",zone="Blackrock Depths",npc="Magmus"},
    [11936]={name="Relic Hunter Belt",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Absent Minded Prospector” — pick it over the other choices. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Absent Minded Prospector",lore="So the prospector wants to send the mysterious fossil to the Explorers' League in Darnassus? I don't feel right leaving Darkshore without him."},
    [11945]={name="Dark Iron Ring",sourceType="object_drop",instructions="Found in a container.",npc="a container"},
    [11946]={name="Fire Opal Necklace",sourceType="object_drop",instructions="Found in a container.",npc="a container"},
    [11962]={name="Manacle Cuffs",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Love Potion” — pick it over the other choices. In Blackrock Depths.",zone="Blackrock Depths",questName="The Love Potion",lore="Oh, the pains of love! My dear Private Rocknot is immune to my charms. I am spurned! It's maddening! You must help me! We succubi know much of love, and I can make a potion to beat down the iron walls around Rocknot's heart."},
    [11981]={name="Lead Band",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop — drops from 380 creature types around level 15-21. Also found on the auction house."},
    [11993]={name="Clay Ring",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop — drops from 383 creature types around level 17-24. Also found on the auction house."},
    [11994]={name="Coral Band",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop — drops from 384 creature types around level 20-26. Also found on the auction house."},
    [12019]={name="Cerulean Talisman",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop — drops from 254 creature types around level 26-33. Also found on the auction house."},
    [12021]={name="Shieldplate Sabatons",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Abandoned Hope” — pick it over the other choices. In Blackrock Depths.",zone="Blackrock Depths",questName="Abandoned Hope",lore="Bolvar is a fool. I was gathering his precious 'proof' so that I could shove it down his throat. He is a blind buffoon. Proof stands two feet away from him and he does not see."},
    [12047]={name="Spectral Necklace",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop — drops from 262 creature types around level 25-31. Also found on the auction house."},
    [12052]={name="Ring of the Moon",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop — drops from 371 creature types around level 16-22. Also found on the auction house."},
    [12053]={name="Volcanic Rock Ring",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop — drops from 371 creature types around level 16-22. Also found on the auction house."},
    [12054]={name="Demon Band",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop — drops from 363 creature types around level 19-26. Also found on the auction house."},
    [12059]={name="Conqueror's Medallion",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Operation: Death to Angerforge”. In Blackrock Depths.",zone="Blackrock Depths",questName="Operation: Death to Angerforge",lore="You have done an exemplary job. It is now time to send you on your last mission. General Angerforge, the Dark Iron responsible for coordinating the attacks on the 109th division of the K.E.F."},
    [12110]={name="Raincaster Drape",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Rise of the Machines” — pick it over the other choices. In Blackrock Depths.",zone="Blackrock Depths",questName="The Rise of the Machines",lore="This can't be Argelmach! Argelmach was killed ten years ago. How can I be sure? I was the one who killed him. He was a despicable dwarf, hell-bent on twisting my life's work to meet his diabolical needs."},
    [12115]={name="Stalwart Clutch",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Disharmony of Fire” — pick it over the other choices. In Blackrock Depths.",zone="Blackrock Depths",questName="Disharmony of Fire",lore="I can taste the foulness in the air that surrounds you. There is another, hidden in the depths of Blackrock, who does control this foulness."},
