    [21134]={name="Dark Edge of Insanity",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from C'Thun in Temple of Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="C'Thun",lore="An Old God, buried under Ahn'Qiraj by the titans rather than killed. It has been whispering to the qiraji ever since, and the whole war exists because it never stopped.",proc="Chance on hit: Disorients the target, causing it to wander aimlessly for up to 3 sec."},
    [21180]={name="Earthstrike",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Champion's Battlegear” — pick it over the other choices. In Silithus.",zone="Silithus",questName="Champion's Battlegear",lore="The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Cenarion Hold are more than just for show. You'd be wise to hold on to them.",proc="Use: Increases your melee and ranged attack power by 280.  Effect lasts for 20 sec. (2 Min Cooldown)"},
    [21201]={name="Signet Ring of the Bronze Dragonflight",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Path of the Conqueror”. In Tanaris.",zone="Tanaris",questName="The Path of the Conqueror"},
    [21206]={name="Signet Ring of the Bronze Dragonflight",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Path of the Invoker”. In Tanaris.",zone="Tanaris",questName="The Path of the Invoker"},
    [21269]={name="Blessed Qiraji Bulwark",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Imperial Qiraji Armaments” — pick it over the other choices. In Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Imperial Qiraji Armaments",lore="We have not sat idly by for a millennium. We have watched these beasts feast on their own when they have exhausted their utility. We have listened as they have plotted and schemed to destroy our world."},
    [21316]={name="Leggings of the Ursa",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Deadwood of the North” — pick it over the other choices. In Timbermaw Hold.",zone="Timbermaw Hold",questName="Deadwood of the North",lore="There is a camp of Deadwood furbolgs directly to our southwest. Corruption permeates the camp, and I wish to put an end to it before they become a problem."},
    [21387]={name="Avenger's Crown",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Avenger's Crown”. In Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Avenger's Crown",lore="The Twin Emperors... their incessant whispers are slowly taking a toll on my sanity. They mock me, knowing I cannot step further into their domain to save my brother Arygos."},
    [21388]={name="Avenger's Greaves",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Avenger's Greaves”. In Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Avenger's Greaves",lore="Qiraji magic is strong and ancient. The most powerful qiraji wield items of such might, they'd give pause even to a dragon."},
    [21389]={name="Avenger's Breastplate",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Avenger's Breastplate”. In Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Avenger's Breastplate",lore="The unmentionable Old God slowly awakens from his slumber beneath Ahn'Qiraj. The terrible fate that awaits Azeroth could come in days or years; time has no meaning for beings of his power."},
    [21390]={name="Avenger's Legguards",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Avenger's Legguards”. In Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Avenger's Legguards",lore="You seek to prove your worth to my kind, mortal? Very well, perhaps we can be of mutual assistance. The ancient sandworm, Ouro, is a being of legendary power."},
    [21391]={name="Avenger's Pauldrons",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Avenger's Pauldrons”. In Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Avenger's Pauldrons",lore="Bring me the bindings worn by the highest Qiraji leaders and I shall shape them into a set of pauldrons more dreadful than even the wings of Nefarian himself!"},
    [21456]={name="Sandstorm Cloak",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ossirian the Unscarred in Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Ossirian the Unscarred",lore="A qiraji lieutenant holding the Ruins, whose name stopped being accurate the first time a raid used the crystals against him."},
    [21479]={name="Gauntlets of the Immovable",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Moam in Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Moam",lore="A stone giant pressed into qiraji service, who drains the mana of everyone fighting him and turns to rock when full."},
    [21503]={name="Belt of the Sand Reaver",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Kurinnaxx in Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Kurinnaxx"},
    [21507]={name="Amulet of the Shifting Sands",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Fall of Ossirian” — pick it over the other choices. In Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",questName="The Fall of Ossirian",lore="A terrible menace has been laid to rest. The cruel Ossirian has been vanquished. The denizens of Kalimdor would be relieved to know of this victory."},
    [21567]={name="Rune of Duty",sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Illiyana Moonblaze in Mor'shan Base Camp — costs tokens or reputation.",zone="Mor'shan Base Camp",npc="Illiyana Moonblaze"},
    [21568]={name="Rune of Duty",sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Illiyana Moonblaze in Mor'shan Base Camp — costs tokens or reputation.",zone="Mor'shan Base Camp",npc="Illiyana Moonblaze"},
    [21581]={name="Gauntlets of Annihilation",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from C'Thun in Temple of Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="C'Thun",lore="An Old God, buried under Ahn'Qiraj by the titans rather than killed. It has been whispering to the qiraji ever since, and the whole war exists because it never stopped."},
    [21583]={name="Cloak of Clarity",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from C'Thun in Temple of Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="C'Thun",lore="An Old God, buried under Ahn'Qiraj by the titans rather than killed. It has been whispering to the qiraji ever since, and the whole war exists because it never stopped."},
    [21598]={name="Royal Qiraji Belt",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Emperor Vek'lor in Temple of Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Emperor Vek'lor",lore="Twin emperor of the qiraji, and the one who inherited C'Thun's gift for magic instead of his brother's strength. Neither twin can be killed far from the other."},
    [21601]={name="Ring of Emperor Vek'lor",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Emperor Vek'lor in Temple of Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Emperor Vek'lor",lore="Twin emperor of the qiraji, and the one who inherited C'Thun's gift for magic instead of his brother's strength. Neither twin can be killed far from the other."},
    [21604]={name="Bracelets of Royal Redemption",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Emperor Vek'nilash in Temple of Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Emperor Vek'nilash",lore="Twin emperor of the qiraji, and the stronger arm of the pair. Kill one and the other heals him, so both must fall together."},
    [21609]={name="Regenerating Belt of Vek'nilash",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Emperor Vek'nilash in Temple of Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Emperor Vek'nilash",lore="Twin emperor of the qiraji, and the stronger arm of the pair. Kill one and the other heals him, so both must fall together."},
    [21615]={name="Don Rigoberto's Lost Hat",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ouro.",npc="Ouro",lore="A sandworm grown enormous under the desert, surfacing only to feed."},
    [21617]={name="Wasphide Gauntlets",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Princess Huhuran in Temple of Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Princess Huhuran",lore="A qiraji brood matron whose poison is potent enough that the fight is really a race against her venom."},
